1510
01:23:26,102 --> 01:23:28,071
<i>ATV-mu menyala.
Kami menuju pelabuhan.</i>

1511
01:23:28,304 --> 01:23:29,572
<font color="#d9ffb9">Ayo cepat! Cepat!</font>

1512
01:23:42,818 --> 01:23:44,253
<i>Bronco, kita harus bergerak.</i>

1513
01:23:44,387 --> 01:23:46,255
<i>Baker, statusmu?</i>

1514
01:23:46,522 --> 01:23:48,591
<i>- Baker?</i>
- Aku dalam perjalanan!

1515
01:23:49,458 --> 01:23:51,394
<i>Baker, sudah dua menit. Saatnya pergi.</i>

1516
01:23:51,627 --> 01:23:52,907
Aku bilang aku dalam perjalanan.

1517
01:23:56,165 --> 01:23:58,045
<i>Keluar lewat depan,
terowongan sudah dikompromi.</i>

1518
01:24:06,842 --> 01:24:07,842
Aargh!

1519
01:24:10,846 --> 01:24:12,281
<i>Sial, Baker! Jawab!
Apa yang kau lakukan?</i>

1520
01:24:12,381 --> 01:24:14,061
Aku akan bertemu kalian
di titik ekstraksi.

1521
01:24:22,925 --> 01:24:24,627
<i>- Baker!</i>
- Aku tepat di belakangmu.

1522
01:24:24,760 --> 01:24:26,195
<i>Kau tak di belakangku, Baker!</i>

1523
01:24:26,362 --> 01:24:27,830
<i>Keluar dari sana!
Itu perintah!</i>

1524
01:24:29,398 --> 01:24:30,398
<i>Itu perintah!</i>

1525
01:24:31,567 --> 01:24:32,567
<i>Sial!</i>

1526
01:24:35,604 --> 01:24:37,573
Sial. Pastikan Ibu keluar dari pulau.

1527
01:24:37,674 --> 01:24:38,702
<i>Apa yang kau lakukan?</i>

1528
01:24:38,803 --> 01:24:41,444
<i>Jangan lakukan itu!
Jangan kau lakukan!</i>

1529
01:24:41,577 --> 01:24:43,011
<i>Baker! Baker!</i>

1530
01:25:06,469 --> 01:25:07,570
Aargh!

1531
01:25:10,739 --> 01:25:11,807
Uh!

1532
01:25:31,560 --> 01:25:33,596
Rachel, ikut aku!
Sid, ayo!

1533
01:25:46,409 --> 01:25:49,345
<i>Moreno, Gucci,
kami dua menit dari dermaga.</i>

1534
01:25:49,478 --> 01:25:51,180
<i>Copy. Kami siap berangkat.</i>

1535
01:26:11,009 --> 01:26:11,933
Sial!

1536
01:26:22,345 --> 01:26:23,812
Ah... urgh!

1537
01:26:23,946 --> 01:26:25,281
Sial!

1538
01:26:44,967 --> 01:26:46,201
Putar lagi!

1539
01:26:53,240 --> 01:26:54,240
Jarak?

1540
01:26:54,410 --> 01:26:55,410
Tunggu.

1541
01:26:58,080 --> 01:26:59,080
Aku bilang, "jarak."

1542
01:26:59,582 --> 01:27:00,816
Aku bilang, "tunggu."

1543
01:27:04,152 --> 01:27:07,523
Tiga ratus. Eh, tunggu, 275.

1544
01:27:07,756 --> 01:27:09,492
- Putuskan.
- 250. Hantam, Janet.

1545
01:27:13,396 --> 01:27:14,396
Aaah!

1546
01:27:49,898 --> 01:27:50,898
Ayo.

1547
01:27:51,900 --> 01:27:52,900
Baker?

1548
01:27:54,136 --> 01:27:55,136
Tidak.

1549
01:27:57,740 --> 01:27:58,740
Bawa dia ke kapal.

1550
01:28:00,576 --> 01:28:01,577
Kami menyusul.

1551
01:28:27,169 --> 01:28:29,104
Kupikir aku mampir sebelum pergi.

1552
01:28:31,840 --> 01:28:33,075
Tak ada dendam, kan?

1553
01:28:33,208 --> 01:28:34,943
Ah, aku sudah dibayar.

1554
01:28:35,411 --> 01:28:36,936
Jadi, semua senang.

1555
01:28:37,037 --> 01:28:40,383
Yah, tidak sepenuhnya, sebenarnya.
Aku baru dari atas.

1556
01:28:40,483 --> 01:28:41,850
Begitu rupanya.

1557
01:28:42,203 --> 01:28:46,254
Sepertinya seluruh kekacauan Salazar
masih berlanjut.

1558
01:28:48,023 --> 01:28:49,257
Kenapa aku harus peduli?

1559
01:28:49,958 --> 01:28:52,561
Tak ada yang tahu di mana dia.
Dia menghilang.

1560
01:28:52,861 --> 01:28:53,962
Kami menyusul.

1561
01:29:05,474 --> 01:29:06,475
Hei!

1562
01:29:22,677 --> 01:29:25,083
<font color="#d9ffb9">Mimpi yang indah, Bajingan.</font>

1563
01:29:26,161 --> 01:29:27,162
<font color="#d9ffb9">Berengsek...</font>

1564
01:29:49,203 --> 01:29:50,882
<i>Kau sudah melewati batas, Bobby.</i>

1565
01:29:50,997 --> 01:29:53,522
<i>Seharusnya kau ambil jalan keluar
saat ada kesempatan.</i>

1566
01:29:53,656 --> 01:29:55,524
<i>Aku sudah menyelesaikan
masalah ini untukmu,</i>

1567
01:29:55,658 --> 01:29:57,960
<i>tapi kau serakah dan merusaknya.</i>

1568
01:29:58,226 --> 01:30:01,530
Jadi, Sid dan Bronco sekarang
akan menyelesaikannya dengan cara mereka.

1569
01:30:01,697 --> 01:30:03,599
Seseorang harus menanggungnya.

1570
01:30:03,699 --> 01:30:05,583
Seseorang harus dikubur.

1571
01:30:07,002 --> 01:30:08,437
Itu bukan aku.

1572
01:30:08,910 --> 01:30:11,039
<i>Yah, mari berharap Salazar tak muncul,</i>

1573
01:30:11,173 --> 01:30:13,241
<i>karena kalau dia muncul,
dia akan jadi saksi negara</i>

1574
01:30:13,375 --> 01:30:14,710
<i>melawan Spencer Goldstein</i>

1575
01:30:14,811 --> 01:30:16,679
<i>atas pendanaan organisasi kriminal.</i>

1576
01:30:16,845 --> 01:30:18,847
Selamat datang di Miami, Tuan Salazar.

1577
01:30:24,419 --> 01:30:25,854
Siapa sih Tuan Salazar?

1578
01:30:26,955 --> 01:30:28,023
Aku Tuan Smith.

1579
01:30:29,925 --> 01:30:32,170
Selama telepon merah kecil itu
tak berdering,

1580
01:30:33,128 --> 01:30:34,488
aku yakin kau akan baik-baik saja.

1581
01:30:36,298 --> 01:30:37,298
Sayang kamu, Bobby.

1582
